 <h2>12. Inline conditionals — brace ladder</h2>
 <p>
  Brace height (
  <code>.c1</code>
  …
  <code>.c8</code>
  ) grows with the branch count.
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>c</var>
   <sub>a</sub>
   (
   <var>x</var>
   )  =
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c1">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if
     <var>x</var>
     &gt; 0:
     <span class="o0">
      <span class="r">√</span>
      <var>x</var>
     </span>
     <br/>
     else: 0
    </span>
   </span>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>c</var>
   <sub>b</sub>
   (
   <var>x</var>
   )  =
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c2">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 1: 1
     <br/>
     else if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 2: 2
     <br/>
     else: 0
    </span>
   </span>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>c</var>
   <sub>c</sub>
   (
   <var>x</var>
   )  =
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c3">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if
     <var>x</var>
     &gt; 0:
     <span class="b2">(</span>
     <span class="dvc up">
      1 +
      <span class="dvc down">
       1
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       1 +
       <span class="dvc">
        1
        <span class="dvl">
        </span>
        2
       </span>
      </span>
     </span>
     <span class="b2">)</span>
     ÷
     <span class="b1">(</span>
     1 −
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
     <span class="b1">)</span>
     <br/>
     else: 0
    </span>
   </span>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>c</var>
   <sub>d</sub>
   (
   <var>x</var>
   )  =
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c4">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 1: 1
     <br/>
     else if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 2: 2
     <br/>
     else if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 3: 3
     <br/>
     else if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 4: 4
     <br/>
     else: 0
    </span>
   </span>
  </span>
 </p>
